  "bodyHash": "f1b75a414fe266cc",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。充满爱意打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于本模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">GUI Clock 是一款极简风格的客户端模组，当背包中存在时钟时，会在屏幕 GUI 中显示时间。它可以显示游戏内时间或现实时间，支持 24 小时制或 12 小时制（AM/PM）。它还能在时间下方显示世界已存在的天数。除了以数字形式显示时间外，还可以选择直接在屏幕上显示时钟图标，该选项可在配置文件中启用。<br><br>默认情况下，当玩家拥有药水效果时，时钟会自动下移以避免遮挡。</span><br><br></p>\n<p>您可能也会对 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gui-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI Compass</a></strong></span> 感兴趣。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 客户端包\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"运行环境：客户端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHaveClockInInventoryForGameTime</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;启用后，仅当背包中存在时钟时才显示游戏时间。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHaveClockInInventoryForRealTime</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;启用后，仅当背包中存在时钟时才显示现实时间。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>lowerClockWhenPlayerHasEffects</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">当玩家拥有药水效果时，是否应将 GUI 中的时钟下移以防止重叠。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>_24hourformat</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;将时钟格式设置为 24 小时制。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showOnlyMinecraftClockIcon</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，将显示时钟物品图标而非数字时钟。若使用 Quark 模组，必须禁用其“Clock Nerf”功能方可生效。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showBothTimes</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">同时显示游戏内时间和本地现实时间。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showRealTime</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;显示实际本地时间而非游戏内时间。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showRealTimeSeconds</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;在时钟中显示秒数。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showDaysPlayedWorld</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">显示在当前世界中游玩的天数。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockPositionIsLeft</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;将 GUI 时钟放置在左侧。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockPositionIsCenter</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;将 GUI 时钟放置在中间。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockPositionIsRight</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;将 GUI 时钟放置在右侧。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockHeightOffset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 5, min 0, max 3000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;时钟的垂直偏移量（Y 坐标）。此值决定时间显示在屏幕上的向下距离。可调整此值以防止 GUI 重叠。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockWidthOffset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 0, min -3000, max 3000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;时钟的水平偏移量（X 坐标）。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>drawTextShadow</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在显示的文本下方绘制阴影。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_R</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 255, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;时钟的红色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_G</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 255, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;时钟的绿色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_B</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 255, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;时钟的蓝色 RGB 值。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>24 小时制时钟。</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"356\" height=\"52\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>12 小时制时钟。</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"380\" height=\"52\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>24 小时制时钟及旁边的电脑本地时间。</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"380\" height=\"56\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>天数计数器：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"319\" height=\"160\"><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>并启用配置选项 '<em>showOnlyMinecraftClockIcon</em>' 时：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"736\" height=\"166\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">启用配置选项 'lowerClockWhenPlayerHasEffects' 后，当药水效果激活时，时钟会自动下移：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"614\" height=\"476\"></strong></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用本模组，只要下载源仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论区已关闭，因为我无法在众多独立的模组页面中逐一跟进评论。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
